---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<div class="container">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="about-image">
      <img src="/public/headshot.jpg" alt="Dominic Critchlow" />
    </div>
    <p>I'm Dominic Critchlow. I build and deploy AI products, currently as a forward-deployed product manager at <a href="https://fractional.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fractional AI</a>. Before that I led AI engineering teams for the Department of Defense. On the side I teach a graduate Big Data Analytics course at Seton Hall.</p>
    <p>Off hours I make small things for the fun of it: iOS apps, data visualizations, and radio + machine learning experiments. The latest is <a href="/pinned/">Pinned</a>, a native iOS app for saving the places you care about, now on the App Store.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Latest</h2>
    <ul class="posts-list">
      {%- for item in collections.latest -%}
      <li class="post-item" data-type="{{ item.type }}">
        <div class="post-title">
          {%- if item.type == "project" and item.logo -%}
          <span class="project-logo">{{ item.logo | safe }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if item.type == "project" -%}
          <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.title }}</a>
          {%- else -%}
          <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="post-meta">
          {{ item.type }}
          {%- if item.type == "project" and item.github -%}
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;<a href="{{ item.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a>
          {%- endif -%}
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;<time datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ item.date | readableDate }}</time>
        </div>
        {%- if item.description -%}
        <p class="post-description">{{ item.description }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-link">
      <a href="/writing/">All Writing</a> · <a href="/projects/">All Projects</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/gallery/">Photos</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
